      "decision_index": 36,
    },
    {
      "severity": "major",
      "description": "GLM47 used Daze to counter Thoughtseize when their hand was empty (Daze was the last card). Letting Thoughtseize resolve would have resulted in the opponent seeing an empty hand, discarding nothing, and losing 2 life for no benefit. Instead, GLM47 bounced their own Island, setting back their mana development for no reason.",
      "action_taken": "Cast Daze (returning Island to hand) to counter Thoughtseize with an otherwise empty hand",
      "better_line": "Let Thoughtseize resolve. The opponent would see an empty hand, discard nothing, and lose 2 life. GLM47 would keep their land in play and maintain mana development.",
      "type": "blunder",
