    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Casting Orcish Bowmasters before activating Wasteland is suboptimal sequencing. By Wastelanding the opponent's Undercity Sewers first (leaving them with only 1 Island), the opponent would be less able to pay for any counterspells or interact. The player has enough remaining mana (2 Underground Seas + Swamp = 3 sources after sacrificing Wasteland) to still cast Bowmasters afterward.",
      "action_taken": "Cast Orcish Bowmasters before using Wasteland",
