    {
      "severity": "questionable",
      "description": "Allowing a second Orcish Bowmasters to resolve makes it extremely difficult to recover, as every cantrip drawn will now deal 2 damage and create 2 amass triggers. With GLM47 already behind on board and needing to cantrip to find threats like Murktide Regent, two Bowmasters essentially locks them out of their primary game plan.",
