    {
      "severity": "questionable",
      "description": "Putting Thoughtseize back on top of the library instead of the second Daze. The opponent has multiple untapped lands (Underground Sea, Swamp), making Daze easy to pay for. Thoughtseize provides hand information and guaranteed disruption, which is more valuable than a second Daze the opponent can pay through.",
