      "severity": "major",
      "description": "Gem3P passed without taking any action in precombat main when they could play Island and cast Murktide Regent via Delve (exiling 4 graveyard cards, paying {1}{U}{U}), creating a 6/6 flyer. Combined with the existing board of ~6 power (2 Bowmasters + Orc Army token), this would represent lethal damage against an opponent at 7 life. Even without Murktide, Wasteland on opponent's Undercity Sewers would be valuable.",
